       (Sects can require them by tag). canBeDesiredForIdeo is left at true (vanilla default, as Apparel_Robe) on robes and hanfu. -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
    <defName>CVG_Apparel_RobeOuter</defName>
    <label>outer disciple robe</label>
    <description>A plain wide-sleeved robe dyed in the color of the sect, handed to every new disciple on the day they pass the gate trial. The custom comes from the Azure Peak, whose founder Qing Feng wore one patched robe for forty years to remember that the sword, not the cloth, makes the cultivator. Its loose weave lets the qi of the air seep a little faster into the body.</description>
    <possessionCount>1</possessionCount>
    <recipeMaker>
      <recipeUsers><li>CVG_SpiritLoom</li><li>HandTailoringBench</li></recipeUsers>
      <displayPriority>300</displayPriority>
    </recipeMaker>
    <graphicData>
      <!-- Final art: Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/CVG/RobeOuter (see docs/modulos/ROPA.md) -->
      <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/CVG/RobeOuter</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.05</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <costStuffCount>55</costStuffCount>
    <stuffCategories><li>Fabric</li><li>Leathery</li></stuffCategories>
    <thingCategories><li>ApparelMisc</li></thingCategories>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>160</MaxHitPoints>
      <WorkToMake>6000</WorkToMake>
      <Mass>1.0</Mass>
      <StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>0.3</StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>
      <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>0.6</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>
      <StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>0.8</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Heat>
      <EquipDelay>2</EquipDelay>
    </statBases>
    <equippedStatOffsets><CVG_QiRegen>0.3</CVG_QiRegen></equippedStatOffsets>
    <apparel>
      <bodyPartGroups><li>Torso</li><li>Neck</li><li>Shoulders</li><li>Arms</li><li>Legs</li></bodyPartGroups>
      <wornGraphicPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/CVG/RobeOuter</wornGraphicPath>
      <layers><li>Shell</li></layers>
      <defaultOutfitTags><li>Worker</li></defaultOutfitTags>
      <tags>
        <li>CVG_Cultivator</li>
        <li>CVG_SectOuter</li>
        <li>Robe</li>
      </tags>
      <canBeDesiredForIdeo>true</canBeDesiredForIdeo>
    </apparel>
    <tradeTags><li>BasicClothing</li></tradeTags>
    <colorGenerator Class="ColorGenerator_Options">
      <options><li><weight>10</weight><only>(0.55,0.65,0.8)</only></li></options>
    </colorGenerator>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
    <defName>CVG_Apparel_RobeInner</defName>
    <label>inner disciple robe</label>
    <description>A finely cut robe with embroidered hems, given only to disciples admitted to the inner courtyards of a sect. The cloud patterns on the cuffs are not decoration: they trace the twelve main meridians, so that the qi the wearer gathers flows along the right paths. In Jiuxiao it was said that an inner disciple could be recognised from a hundred steps by sleeves that move without wind.</description>
    <possessionCount>1</possessionCount>
    <recipeMaker>
      <recipeUsers><li>CVG_SpiritLoom</li><li>HandTailoringBench</li></recipeUsers>
