    <label>elder robe</label>
    <description>A heavy ceremonial robe with the emblem of the sect stitched on the back in thread soaked in spirit stone dust. The elders of the Nine Heavens wore them through the Iron Calamity, and many sects still keep the scorched robes of their fallen as relics. The stones widen the qi pool of the wearer, and its weight alone commands respect in any hall.</description>
