  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
    <defName>CVG_Apparel_Hanfu</defName>
    <label>hanfu</label>
    <description>A layered under-robe of soft cloth with a crossed collar, closed left over right as the living wear it; only the dead are dressed right over left. It is the daily garment of every village of Jiuxiao, from rice farmers to sect clerks, worn alone in summer or under an outer robe. A well-kept hanfu is taken as a sign of good manners.</description>
