  <ThingDef ParentName="HatMakeableBase">
    <defName>CVG_Apparel_BambooHat</defName>
    <label>bamboo hat</label>
    <description>A wide conical hat of woven bamboo, the mark of rogue cultivators and wandering swordsmen who own little else. Legend says the first one was woven by a monk of the Silent Lotus to shade a dying stranger, who later became a saint and never wore anything else on his head. It keeps off sun and rain, and hides the eyes of anyone who would rather not be recognised.</description>
    <possessionCount>1</possessionCount>
    <recipeMaker>
      <recipeUsers><li>CVG_SpiritLoom</li><li>HandTailoringBench</li></recipeUsers>
      <displayPriority>300</displayPriority>
