  <ThingDef ParentName="NobleHatMakeableBase">
    <defName>CVG_Apparel_JadeCrown</defName>
    <label>jade crown</label>
    <description>A small hairpin crown of carved jade and silver, the guan worn by those who have faced their inner demon and not looked away. Jade is said to remember calm the way a pond remembers the moon, and the Heavenly Cauldron Pavilion sells these as "heart-steadying crowns" at every auction. A steady Dao heart makes a breakthrough a little more likely.</description>
