  <ThingDef ParentName="ArmorSmithableBase">
    <defName>CVG_Apparel_ScaleArmor</defName>
    <label>spirit scale armor</label>
    <description>Overlapping scales of spirit metal or spirit leather sewn onto a quilted robe, the standard armor of the Azure Peak sword patrols. During the Iron Calamity its smiths learned to hammer scales from the husks of fallen machines, and the shape has not changed since. Medium protection that slows a cultivator less than plate. It has spirit grade 1.</description>
